# Generated.xcconfig lo escribe Flutter en cada maquina y contiene rutas
# ABSOLUTAS (FLUTTER_ROOT). Versionarlo hace que el Podfile de otra maquina
# intente cargar el podhelper desde la ruta del PC original: en un Mac que
# clona desde Windows, `pod install` falla con
#   cannot load such file -- .../ios/C:\flutter\src\flutter\...\podhelper
# Se regenera solo con `flutter pub get` o `flutter build ios --config-only`.
Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
Flutter/ephemeral/
Flutter/app.flx
Flutter/app.zip
Flutter/flutter_assets/
Flutter/flutter_export_environment.sh
ServiceDefinitions.json
Runner/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*

# Exceptions to above rules.
!default.mode1v3
!default.mode2v3
!default.pbxuser
!default.perspectivev3
